etty  routinely teach and I just hadn't got to  them yet so I started working on those  and similarly with Pascal's ponce's I  had projected a whole series of videos  on that work got some done years ago and  then resumed work on it this last month  I also did a few uh quick takes videos  on topics that I thought were important  I'll probably be doing some writing  about those Topics in the near future a  couple Sadler's stories including one  about what Christmas used to be like in  the LA Marie's family that's my mother's  side of the family French Canadian  although you know living in America and  bringing uh spouses down from Quebec  back for several Generations  what else we had a wisdom for Life show  and that's episode 61 you might find  interesting about taking down time  evil Sadler made an appearance nobody  should listen to him let me remind  everybody I also finally finished up did  a lot of like you know getting getting  things tidied up and and finished up  this time uh when I did the Ursula K Le  guine Earthsea class I did about I don't  know 80 90 videos and I didn't get to  four of them that I'd intended to do on  her story dragonfly which which is quite  important it's found in Tales of uh of  Earthsea or Tales From Earthsea and so I  got those done as well and then I did  one book review on Tim Iverson's calm  and curious which is about stoicism and  education  um what else you know we had our um  podcast stuff I was working through a  lot of Cicero's on duties and published  all of those and then we held a vote  early on in the month if I remember and  people really wanted more Aristotle so I  did some Aristotle podcast stuff as well  on book three which has to do with  responsibility and you know our  different faculties  and you know I also produced some other  podcasts for uh which I've early  released to patreon supporters and I'll  talk more about that in the December or  in the January time uh because you'll be  seeing those fairly shortly 